{"id":93,"name":"الضحى","transliteration":"Ad-Duhaa","translation_fr":"Le jour montant","translation_en":"The Morning Hours","type":"meccan","total_verses":11,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","translation_fr":"Par le Jour Montant","translation_en":"By the morning brightness","transliteration":"Waaldduha"},{"id":2,"text":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","translation_fr":"Et par la nuit quand elle couvre tout","translation_en":"And [by] the night when it covers with darkness","transliteration":"Waallayli itha saja"},{"id":3,"text":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ton Seigneur ne t'a ni abandonné, ni détesté","translation_en":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muhammad], nor has He detested [you]","transliteration":"Ma waddaAAaka rabbuka wama qala"},{"id":4,"text":"وَلَلۡأٓخِرَةُ خَيۡرٞ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلۡأُولَىٰ","translation_fr":"La vie dernière t'est, certes, meilleure que la vie présente","translation_en":"And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life]","transliteration":"Walalakhiratu khayrun laka mina aloola"},{"id":5,"text":"وَلَسَوۡفَ يُعۡطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرۡضَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Ton Seigneur t'accordera certes [Ses faveurs], et alors tu seras satisfait","translation_en":"And your Lord is going to give you, and you will be satisfied","transliteration":"Walasawfa yuAAteeka rabbuka fatarda"},{"id":6,"text":"أَلَمۡ يَجِدۡكَ يَتِيمٗا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ne t'a-t-Il pas trouvé orphelin? Alors Il t'a accueilli","translation_en":"Did He not find you an orphan and give [you] refuge","transliteration":"Alam yajidka yateeman faawa"},{"id":7,"text":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلّٗا فَهَدَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ne t'a-t-Il pas trouvé égaré? Alors Il t'a guidé","translation_en":"And He found you lost and guided [you]","transliteration":"Wawajadaka dallan fahada"},{"id":8,"text":"وَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلٗا فَأَغۡنَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ne t'a-t-Il pas trouvé pauvre? Alors Il t'a enrichi","translation_en":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient","transliteration":"Wawajadaka AAailan faaghna"},{"id":9,"text":"فَأَمَّا ٱلۡيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقۡهَرۡ","translation_fr":"Quant à l'orphelin, donc, ne le maltraite pas","translation_en":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him]","transliteration":"Faamma alyateema fala taqhar"},{"id":10,"text":"وَأَمَّا ٱلسَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنۡهَرۡ","translation_fr":"Quant au demandeur, ne le repousse pas","translation_en":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him]","transliteration":"Waamma alssaila fala tanhar"},{"id":11,"text":"وَأَمَّا بِنِعۡمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثۡ","translation_fr":"Et quant au bienfait de ton Seigneur, proclame-le","translation_en":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it]","transliteration":"Waamma biniAAmati rabbika fahaddith"}]}